    slug: 'label-ai-fairness-metric',
    name: 'AI Fairness Metric Matrix',
    description: 'Four-metric fairness matrix: demographic parity, equalized odds, predictive parity, individual fairness. Each metric defined with formula, threshold, applicable tier, and intervention trigger. Aligned with EEOC 4/5ths Rule + EU AI Act Article 10.',
    category: 'label',
