    slug: 'form-climate-scenario',
    name: 'Climate Scenario Analysis Form — NGFS Pathways',
    description: 'Four NGFS climate scenario pathways: Orderly, Disorderly, Hot House World, Net Zero. Each pathway captured with temperature outcome, transition risk, physical risk, policy stringency, and MAC (Marginal Abatement Cost) curve.',
    category: 'form',
