    description: 'Social capital metric framework: (1) Algorithmic fairness as ESG metric, (2) Customer outcome fairness (Consumer Duty), (3) Workforce diversity & inclusion, (4) Community investment. Maps to ESRS S1, ISSB S1, GRI 401-403.',
